WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:01,300
wise man

2
00:00:01,560 --> 00:00:03,120
do you know who i am

3
00:00:03,740 --> 00:00:05,340
Offending the Huo family will not bring good results

4
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:16,390
But get out alive first and let them get out of the way and leave Wen Chen.

5
00:00:18,770 --> 00:00:21,270
What nonsense are you talking about that you can leave on your own?

6
00:00:21,550 --> 00:00:22,830
He also has to let me go

7
00:00:23,070 --> 00:00:23,990
leave him

8
00:00:24,230 --> 00:00:25,910
I don't even dare to think about what will happen.

9
00:00:28,430 --> 00:00:31,690
How many bullets are in your gun?

10
00:00:32,130 --> 00:00:33,250
Or eight shots

11
00:00:34,220 --> 00:00:41,990
There are so many people and you can't leave. It's okay. Don't be afraid.

12
00:00:42,190 --> 00:00:44,310
Why don't you ask Huo Yan what she did?

13
00:00:44,590 --> 00:00:45,790
No matter Xiaoyan didn’t do anything

14
00:00:45,950 --> 00:00:47,110
There's no reason for you to hurt her

15
00:00:47,270 --> 00:00:48,870
Repay kindness and revenge

16
00:00:49,110 --> 00:00:51,270
It turns out it’s her fault for having such a tutor, even if she kills someone

17
00:00:51,430 --> 00:00:52,670
It was you untouchables who offended her.

18
00:00:52,830 --> 00:00:54,350
The Huo family is never afraid of the law

19
00:00:54,510 --> 00:00:55,870
Are there too many buildings that have been trampled to death?
